# GS-015: A closed warming–cooling cycle redistributes carbon rather than losing it
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
seal v1 100mL
add v1 CO2 0.001mol
measure v1 thermometer
measure v1 pressure
inspect v1
heat v1 2kJ
measure v1 thermometer
measure v1 pressure
inspect v1
cool v1 2kJ
measure v1 thermometer
measure v1 pressure
inspect
